Second runtest for fsm blocks in .comp files (docs/dev/MODCOMPILE_FSM_DESIGN.md): two fsms in one component, source order between any items, any on against the state's own on, on_exit on a self-transition, the any timeout fallback, a timeout in ms re-read every cycle (including values <= 0, and 9 ms, which a double comparison fired one period late), expression and non-zero defaults, a return in an action (the transition still completes), a hidden state_var, initial other than the first state, and _in() / _state_name() across fsms.
